        "label": "The first drawing",
        "heading": "It started with death and fire.",
        "body": "<p>The first Rizo face came from combining death and fire. I wanted death to feel more palatable. Something people used to acknowledge and even celebrate. Fire was the other half because humans grew with it. We cook with it, build with it, gather around it, survive because of it.</p><p>I put them together. Then I made the face cute.</p>",
